# MagicSquare Project Rule

## Project Context

- Project name: MagicSquare
- Domain: 4x4 magic square generation and validation
- Primary language: Python
- Main goal: keep maintainable codebase with ECB architecture and Dual-Track TDD

## Agent Operating Principles

- Check related tests before writing production code.
- Decompose requirements into testable units first.
- Respect ECB boundaries when proposing or generating code.
- Prefer minimal implementation that satisfies current tests.
- Re-run relevant pytest scope after edits and check for regressions.
